# No em-dashes

Never use em-dashes (U+2014) or en-dashes (U+2013) anywhere in this repository.

Use instead:
- Hyphen `-` for compound words and ranges (e.g. `L0-L6`, `v0.2.0`)
- Colon `:` after labels (e.g. `**L1 Symbols**: functions`)
- Commas or periods for clause breaks

This applies to README, docs, site copy, comments, commit messages, and PR text.
